Third-party skill content
=========================

This repository mixes original skills with copies of upstream Agent Skills.
Original content is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). Third-party skills keep their
upstream licenses. If a skill directory includes LICENSE.txt, that file wins
for that directory.

